<title>GERMANY: Tietmeyer to meet Waigel for talks on reserves this week.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer to meet Waigel for talks on reserves this week.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said on Wednesday he expected final clarification on the revaluation of foreign exchange reserves held at the Bundesbank to be reached soon and would meet Finance Minister Theo Waigel for talks this week.</p>
</text>
